# N4 slice 1, staged (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts: a called catch is one Structure with its own var; Codex
# OPUS-CODEX-20261015-17 (c): a catch payload parameter is a value of the catch activation, never a field of D): the
# parameter w of the catch in S, and the q its handler declares, live today in a cell of the code, which a split call
# must not write. Refused at the parameter until catch values are values of the catch activation.
fn: mk () int
    throws: Oops
    if: 1 = 1
        throw: Oops(5)
    return: 1
end: mk
S:
    int: v 0
    ---
        v: mk()
        catch: Oops (int: w)
            int: q w + 2
            v: q
    ---
end: S
D:
    int: pad 3
    int: v 1
end: D
call: S D
return
